    "description": "The Telecom SIM History Retrieval API allows users to access historical data related to telecom SIM cards. This feature enables businesses to obtain detailed logs of SIM transactions, including activations, deactivations, and usage statistics. Typical consumers of this API include telecom service providers and data analysts looking to track SIM card performance over time. The API provides a comprehensive solution for monitoring and analyzing SIM history, aiding in decision-making and operational efficiency.",
